    <title>Medusa: Simple LLM Inference Acceleration Framework
      with Multiple Decoding Heads</title>
    <summary>  Large language models decode one token at a time. We add extra decoding heads
      that predict several future tokens in parallel, giving a 2x speedup.  </summary>
